{"op": "meta", "chapter": 0, "title": "酒店醒来", "requires": {"characters": ["顾盈", "陆择"], "scenes": ["酒店-客房"], "portraits": ["顾盈.挑眉", "顾盈.玩味", "顾盈.慵懒", "陆择.慵懒", "陆择.玩味", "陆择.轻佻"]}, "line_seq": 28}
{"op": "scene", "id": "s00_酒店", "scene": "酒店-客房", "time": "清晨"}
{"id": "L0001", "op": "narrate", "text": "清晨，一缕阳光从窗帘的缝隙钻进来。"}
{"id": "L0002", "op": "narrate", "text": "昨夜的酒气还没散透。外套歪在椅背上，两只杯子空在床头，谁也没打算收拾。"}
{"id": "L0003", "op": "narrate", "text": "浴室传来哗哗的水声，顾盈的身影透过磨砂玻璃，若隐若现。"}
{"id": "L0004", "op": "narrate", "text": "陆择朦胧地睁开眼睛，摇了摇头，想尽快从宿醉中清醒过来。"}
{"id": "L0005", "op": "narrate", "text": "水声停了，一阵窸窸窣窣之后，顾盈推开门走了出来。"}
{"id": "L0006", "op": "narrate", "text": "白衬衫松松地罩在她身上，下摆垂到大腿，发梢还滴着水。"}
{"id": "L0007", "op": "say", "who": "顾盈", "portrait": "挑眉", "pos": "left", "text": "哟，醒这么早？", "audio": {"key": "顾盈-chapter00_序章-s00_酒店-L0007", "emotion": "调侃", "status": "pending", "attempts": 1, "text_sha1": "7cb1adfcc3e9d66fcb77b9453e7e7711153d967e"}}
{"id": "L0008", "op": "say", "who": "陆择", "portrait": "慵懒", "pos": "right", "text": "嗯……等下还要赶飞机。", "audio": {"key": "陆择-chapter00_序章-s00_酒店-L0008", "emotion": "平静", "status": "pending", "attempts": 1, "text_sha1": "dcc1fdb171cd48b0da500fc2a2ec4a4e44bdae27"}}
{"id": "L0009", "op": "say", "who": "陆择", "portrait": "慵懒", "pos": "right", "text": "这不是我的衬衫嘛。", "audio": {"key": "陆择-chapter00_序章-s00_酒店-L0009", "emotion": "调侃", "status": "pending", "attempts": 1, "text_sha1": "58bec2dcc1bd89d9ab0bad5b1984b894efcceefa"}}
{"id": "L0010", "op": "say", "who": "顾盈", "portrait": "玩味", "pos": "left", "text": "这儿乱七八糟的，随手抓到了这件。", "audio": {"key": "顾盈-chapter00_序章-s00_酒店-L0010", "emotion": "调侃", "status": "pending", "attempts": 1, "text_sha1": "dbf6d92b728267b2d2316e886f2c8da0f9f85ec3"}}
{"id": "L0011", "op": "say", "who": "陆择", "portrait": "玩味", "pos": "right", "text": "别说，你穿着还挺好看。", "audio": {"key": "陆择-chapter00_序章-s00_酒店-L0011", "emotion": "调侃", "status": "pending", "attempts": 1, "text_sha1": "2e77c10527f89d31a6bec0ae372d127a1335c515"}}
{"id": "L0012", "op": "say", "who": "顾盈", "portrait": "挑眉", "pos": "left", "text": "和不穿比呢？", "audio": {"key": "顾盈-chapter00_序章-s00_酒店-L0012", "emotion": "调侃", "status": "pending", "attempts": 1, "text_sha1": "b44e4be154e9e6b84a6410bfd59eb2c310d6946e"}}
{"id": "L0013", "op": "say", "who": "陆择", "portrait": "玩味", "pos": "right", "text": "都好看，各有各的韵味。", "audio": {"key": "陆择-chapter00_序章-s00_酒店-L0013", "emotion": "调侃", "status": "pending", "attempts": 1, "text_sha1": "7f7dc1ac4994e5955448b33e522d198bf594d069"}}
{"id": "L0014", "op": "say", "who": "顾盈", "portrait": "玩味", "pos": "left", "text": "嘴真甜。", "audio": {"key": "顾盈-chapter00_序章-s00_酒店-L0014", "emotion": "调侃", "status": "pending", "attempts": 1, "text_sha1": "298708cb9b690064f172e4ab8193a33b193ac610"}}
{"id": "L0015", "op": "narrate", "text": "顾盈对着镜子擦头发。"}
{"id": "L0016", "op": "say", "who": "顾盈", "portrait": "玩味", "pos": "left", "text": "没看出来你还挺厉害的，要不加个微信？", "audio": {"key": "顾盈-chapter00_序章-s00_酒店-L0016", "emotion": "调侃", "status": "pending", "attempts": 1, "text_sha1": "c4a0689bd9cd18691a6e1dde0c65237661ad90dd"}}
{"id": "L0017", "op": "say", "who": "陆择", "portrait": "轻佻", "pos": "right", "text": "还是别了，昨晚地动山摇的，下次我怕床受不了。", "audio": {"key": "陆择-chapter00_序章-s00_酒店-L0017", "emotion": "调侃", "status": "pending", "attempts": 1, "text_sha1": "fc150bc734783767b8b2fcd2a28afc4cf7e81213"}}
{"id": "L0018", "op": "narrate", "text": "顾盈耸了耸肩，没再坚持。"}
{"id": "L0019", "op": "narrate", "text": "顾盈开始化妆。"}
{"id": "L0020", "op": "say", "who": "陆择", "portrait": "慵懒", "pos": "right", "text": "这附近哪里有咖啡店？", "audio": {"key": "陆择-chapter00_序章-s00_酒店-L0020", "emotion": "平静", "status": "pending", "attempts": 1, "text_sha1": "4efa8337870fc946a1a759b1b7e6250678dd16c2"}}
{"id": "L0021", "op": "say", "who": "顾盈", "portrait": "挑眉", "pos": "left", "text": "怎么，想请我喝咖啡？", "audio": {"key": "顾盈-chapter00_序章-s00_酒店-L0021", "emotion": "调侃", "status": "pending", "attempts": 1, "text_sha1": "806db3b5919aeff5c828a55e18df7a5c205c3901"}}
{"id": "L0022", "op": "say", "who": "陆择", "portrait": "玩味", "pos": "right", "text": "我倒是想，可是等不及你化妆咯，10 点的飞机。", "audio": {"key": "陆择-chapter00_序章-s00_酒店-L0022", "emotion": "调侃", "status": "pending", "attempts": 1, "text_sha1": "818a90234e609546d2f304dc2bf2f65e3553ccc8"}}
{"id": "L0023", "op": "say", "who": "顾盈", "portrait": "慵懒", "pos": "left", "text": "街角有一家，拿铁还不错。", "audio": {"key": "顾盈-chapter00_序章-s00_酒店-L0023", "emotion": "平静", "status": "pending", "attempts": 1, "text_sha1": "d558b9ad2f9600f9de6a07f679cedff8b4acbce0"}}
{"id": "L0024", "op": "say", "who": "陆择", "portrait": "玩味", "pos": "right", "text": "谢啦。", "audio": {"key": "陆择-chapter00_序章-s00_酒店-L0024", "emotion": "平静", "status": "pending", "attempts": 1, "text_sha1": "20491c07236c04add41ba62b2c4c4140f06b49a9"}}
{"id": "L0025", "op": "narrate", "text": "顾盈对着镜子继续上妆，没有要送的意思。"}
{"id": "L0026", "op": "narrate", "text": "陆择穿戴整齐，推门而出。"}
{"id": "L0027", "op": "narrate", "text": "门在身后合上。房间里，吹风机的声音很快响了起来。"}
